{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"さーっそくタイトル使ってみたぜぁ！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あ！黒髪能條、わりかし好評で良かったあーー(*^^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"安心安心。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そうそうあのね？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"実はですね私達一昨日昨日と撮影をしに茨城まで行ってきたんですね... (*^^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/11/3418437/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"パーキングエリアにて。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いやーあの名前忘れたけどスタバの新しいフラペチーノおいちかったなー❤"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ナッツが入ってたの。ちなみにあみは必ずエクストラホイップって言うよ！？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆さんもご賞味あれ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"話がズレたけど、\n正直完成が楽しみすぎてサブイボもんだよー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"サブイボもん！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"わくてかわくてか"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ホテルの同室は、最近すきあらば、どうぶつの森をやってる"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"七瀬と一緒でしたね、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"というより本当は1人1部屋だったんだけどんまぁー1人ってどうなのよ。え？って思ったし、たまたま七瀬と隣の部屋だったから、これは一緒に寝るしか。的な流れで同室になりやした。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/11/3418437/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"真夜中にね、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あみはたこわさ。七瀬は明太子イカ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"というなんともおじさまが好みそうなものをせかせかと2人でむさぼってたよ。笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"愉快でしょ？わたしたち。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして今日！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"初の横浜アリーナで、ハッピーミュージックライブに出させていただきました！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いやーーー横浜アリーナ！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でっっっかい(⊙◞౪◟⊙) ！！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本番客席観たらはてしないお客さんの数で思わずうれしくて「...ウップス。...」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"って言っちゃったよね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"7曲披露したの！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"セトリは、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"•走れ！bicycle！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"•会いたかったかもしれない"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"•音が出ないギター"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"•ハウス"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"•ぐるぐるカーテン"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"•おいでシャンプー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そぉして最後にはサプライズで新曲の、制服のマネキンをライブ初披露しました！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"めーちゃ盛り上がってくれて"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あみたち本当に最高に幸せでしたっ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"制服のマネキン、たくさん愛される曲になるといいな❤"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"じゃっ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あみはようやく家つけて一眠りしてやろうというもくろみなので。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"寝るしか！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/11/3418437/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おやすみちゃん。"}],"source":"archive"}